From 196cb9f513feac380bd1ec794c68d7da267263e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AI Developer <ai-dev@fatehmusic.local>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 09:24:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(instructor): add instructor management (Phase 2)

- migrations/0012: new instructors table, seeded (generated from the
  real src/data/instructors.js module, not hand-typed, to avoid
  transcription errors in the Persian bios) with the SAME ids as that
  file. registrations.instructor_id has existed since migration 0001
  and has always stored those exact ids, so every past and future
  registration is already correctly linked -- zero changes needed on
  registrations itself.
- Section 8 (Student<->Instructor relationship: start_date/end_date/
  course/status) is intentionally not a new junction table.
  registrations already has one row per student+instructor+course+term
  (student_id as of migration 0011) -- getInstructorProfile() answers
  "which students, which course, since when" straight from that,
  instead of duplicating the history into a second table.
- src/server/instructors.ts: list (search + active/inactive filter +
  pagination), full profile (bio + students taught, grouped by
  course), create, update, and deactivate (is_active flag -- Section 7
  explicitly says not to hard-delete once there's teaching history).
- src/pages/api/admin/instructors.ts: GET (list or ?id= profile), POST
  (create), PATCH (update/deactivate). Same admin/registrar gate as
  the students API.
- src/pages/admin/instructors.astro (+ instructors.js,
  instructor-profile.js, instructors.css): list + create + per-
  instructor profile/edit view in the existing admin panel style,
  including an instrument checkbox grid sourced from data/courses.js.
  Nav + dashboard entries added the same way Phase 1's were.

Validated: npx vitest run (92/92, was 85/85 baseline) . npx astro
check (62 errors/3 hints, byte-identical to current main's baseline,
0 new) . npx astro build (clean) . full 12-migration chain replayed
from scratch locally . seed spot-checked against the source file .
getInstructorProfile/listInstructors queries manually verified against
local D1 with a real linked student+registration.
